  "details": "<p>An archaeological site located near Re'im, Israel, the tell sits along the river Besor, 10 km south of Gaza. William Flinders Petrie was the site's first excavator in 1927-1928.\u00a0Smithsonian Institution excavations occurred under the direction of Gus W. van Beek from 1970 to 1990.</p>\r\n<p>This site was continuously occupied for ca. 1400 years from the Middle Bronze Age to the Persian period.</p>",
